<title>GERMANY: TABLE-Aachener Rueck pays 11dmk 96 dividend.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Aachener Rueck pays 11dmk 96 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AACHEN, Germany 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend				     11	vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German reinsurer is Aachener Konzernrueckversicherungs AG. The company said that the full dividend payout including a tax benefit of 1.67 marks per share would be 12.67 marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
